+# Each mechanism has a one-number use_metric (a shell command run from the repo
+# root) and 30 days: review_by = added_on + 30 days. A mechanism past review_by
+# with no measured use becomes optional and its text moves to docs/.
+# `python3 tools/mechanism_review.py` runs the metrics; `--overdue` lists them.
+# status: measured (the metric is a use or effect count and was > 0 when set),
+# unmeasured, retired. AGENTS.md section entries count the files that cite the
+# heading: a citation count, not an effect, hence unmeasured.
+# The 30-day clock starts at registry entry (added_on), not at the mechanism's
